%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6eb4b1be9f74a221cc5daefd0c16d74f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83895b27/uploads/origins/fbe345f5-45de-4c38-a00f-1517a3f344e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6eb4b1be9f74a221cc5daefd0c16d74f, https://si.imgix.net/83895b27/uploads/origins/fbe345f5-45de-4c38-a00f-1517a3f344e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=430de579626e56ee980fc54941067f35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83895b27/uploads/origins/fbe345f5-45de-4c38-a00f-1517a3f344e3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f08f10f65da7887afa8f9268951c3fc 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\n\nCharacter: Medea from Fate\n\nOutfit: This kimono (https://i.imgur.com/8AmFlRZ.jpg)\n\nPicture: Please show her smiling and holding a hamaya arrow (https://i.imgur.com/08NhsoG.jpg)\n\nReferences: https://imgur.com/a/yecju1a\n\nI leave all other details to you. I really like your colorful and soft art style and I would love to see you draw Medea.\n\nThank you!\n\nTranslated text(Japanese): こんにちは。\n\nキャラクターです。Fateのメデア\n\n衣装です。この着物（https://i.imgur.com/8AmFlRZ.jpg）\n\n写真笑顔で破魔矢を持っている姿をお願いします(https://i.imgur.com/08NhsoG.jpg)\n\n参考資料： https://imgur.com/a/yecju1a\n\nその他の詳細は全てお任せします。私はあなたのカラフルでソフトなアートスタイルがとても好きなので、ぜひメデアを描いていただきたいです。\n\nありがとうございました。", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@k6tetsu/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 104681, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4b451fe2/uploads/origins/d8581530-3123-4521-9d6e-af5822ec362f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cf95f2dd7fa6ddab56b05556dfc01198", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4b451fe2/uploads/origins/d8581530-3123-4521-9d6e-af5822ec362f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp